  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from the heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-29b12594.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut tomato into bite-sized chunks. Drain sweetcorn. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook tomato and corn, tossing, until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl.\n• Meanwhile, grate carrot. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-6d525d0e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook plant-based mince and carrot and, breaking up mince with a spoon, until cooked through, 5-6 minutes. TIP: For best results, drain the oil from the pan at the end of this step.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-e4827bba.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add Tex-Mex spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add tomato paste (see ingredients), the water (for the beef) and chicken-style stock powder, stir, then simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-7ff7b40d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. To pan with the 'beef', add rice, tomato and corn, gently stirring to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Transfer to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese. Grill until lightly golden, 6-8 minutes. Little cooks: Help sprinkle the cheese on top.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-75742551.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy Mexican 'mince' and rice bake between plates. Serve with a dollop of light sour cream. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by dolloping over the sour cream!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d8d684f672cb88e70850de/step-5acdc2cb.jpg"
    }
  ]
